# PRODUCT
msgid "home.product.title"
msgstr "Product - Taskwolf"
msgid "home.product.headline"
msgstr "Product"
msgid "home.product.slogan"
msgstr "Automate your environment"
msgid "home.product.description.1"
msgstr "We offer a code-free environment for automation for everyone."
msgid "home.product.description.2"
msgstr "Dive deeper into our offer."
msgid "home.product.workflows.headline"
msgstr "Workflows"
msgid "home.product.workflows.slogan"
msgstr "We take on repetitive tasks for you"
msgid "home.product.workflows.description.1"
msgstr "Workflows are used to automate small processes within their environment."
msgid "home.product.workflows.description.2"
msgstr "They enable the reduction and complete removal of repetitive tasks."
msgid "home.product.workflows.trigger.headline"
msgstr "Trigger"
msgid "home.product.workflows.trigger.description"
msgstr "They are the root of every workflow. This is because the triggers set the workflow in motion and initiate the chain of actions or conditions."
msgid "home.product.workflows.action.headline"
msgstr "Action"
msgid "home.product.workflows.action.description"
msgstr "Actions fulfill a task selected by you when the workflow is triggered. The order in which the actions are executed is sequential."
msgid "home.product.workflows.condition.headline"
msgstr "Condition"
msgid "home.product.workflows.condition.description"
msgstr "The conditions control the sequential process and can, for example, interrupt the further execution of actions."
msgid "home.product.processes.headline"
msgstr "Processes"
msgid "home.product.processes.slogan"
msgstr "Connect workflows with each other"
msgid "home.product.processes.description.1"
msgstr "In many cases it is an interplay of workflows that enables the most efficient automation. This is exactly what processes are used for."
msgid "home.product.processes.description.2"
msgstr "Each process is a sequence of so-called 'steps'. A step consists of a title, a description and to-dos. Furthermore, each step can execute a workflow."
msgid "home.product.organizations.headline"
msgstr "Organizations"
msgid "home.product.organizations.slogan"
msgstr "Working together to advance automation"
msgid "home.product.organizations.description"
msgstr "An organization is a group of several Taskwolf users. They can automate together and thus save all members a lot of time. Because none of us is as smart as all of us."
msgid "home.product.organizations.owner.headline"
msgstr "Owner"
msgid "home.product.organizations.owner.description"
msgstr "Manages the organization."
msgid "home.product.organizations.member.headline"
msgstr "Member"
msgid "home.product.organizations.member.description"
msgstr "Is part of the team and has access to shared workflows, processes, databases, webhooks, accounts and devices."
msgid "home.product.devices.headline"
msgstr "Devices"
msgid "home.product.devices.slogan"
msgstr "Integrate your devices into the automation"
msgid "home.product.devices.description.1"
msgstr "For many applications, it is helpful to integrate your devices into workflows. We enable you to do this with the Taskwolf app."
msgid "home.product.devices.description.2"
msgstr "It allows you to send notifications through workflow, execute commands on your device or manage files on your devices."
msgid "home.product.advanced.headline"
msgstr "Advanced functions"
msgid "home.product.advanced.slogan"
msgstr "Use all the features we offer"
msgid "home.product.advanced.description"
msgstr "Taskwolf has a wide range of functions to help you with the automation process."
msgid "home.product.advanced.transformation.headline"
msgstr "Data transformation"
msgid "home.product.advanced.transformation.description"
msgstr "Use workflows to convert data from various formats into other formats and then use them"
msgid "home.product.advanced.timeline.headline"
msgstr "Workflow timeline"
msgid "home.product.advanced.timeline.description"
msgstr "Use the workflow timeline to monitor the execution, changes and errors that have occurred in the workflows"
msgid "home.product.advanced.condition.headline"
msgstr "Conditions"
msgid "home.product.advanced.condition.description"
msgstr "Control the flow of workflows by simply adding conditions for further execution"
msgid "home.product.advanced.webhook.headline"
msgstr "Webhooks"
msgid "home.product.advanced.webhook.description"
msgstr "Workflows can be triggered by webhooks or external webhooks can be called by workflows"
msgid "home.product.advanced.database.headline"
msgstr "Databases"
msgid "home.product.advanced.database.description"
msgstr "In many use cases, it can be practical to save data for or through workflows. We offer the database feature for this purpose"
msgid "home.product.advanced.template.headline"
msgstr "Templates"
msgid "home.product.advanced.template.description"
msgstr "There are already many templates that you can use as inspiration for your use cases"
msgid "home.product.get.headline"
msgstr "Interested?"
msgid "home.product.get.slogan"
msgstr "Get Taskwolf now!"
msgid "home.product.get.description"
msgstr "If you are now interested in our product, you can find out about our various offers and packages. There is sure to be something for you."
msgid "home.product.get.button"
msgstr "GET IT NOW"

# SOLUTION
msgid "home.solution.title"
msgstr "Solution - Taskwolf"
msgid "home.solution.headline"
msgstr "Solution"
msgid "home.solution.slogan"
msgstr "Let us convince you"
msgid "home.solution.description.1"
msgstr "We are convinced that Taskwolf can be integrated into anyone's workflows."
msgid "home.solution.description.2"
msgstr "Are you not sure? We'll show you."
msgid "home.solution.jobs.headline"
msgstr "Jobs"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.slogan"
msgstr "That's how versatile Taskwolf is"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.description.1"
msgstr "Here you will find various ideas on how to use Taskwolf in different areas."
msgid "home.solution.jobs.description.2"
msgstr "This is just a small selection. There are many areas of application for Taskwolf."
msgid "home.solution.jobs.description.3"
msgstr "The only limitation is your creativity."
msgid "home.solution.jobs.sales"
msgstr "Sales"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.sales.use.case.1.title"
msgstr "Acceleration of order processing"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.sales.use.case.1.description"
msgstr "Automate your order processing to provide your customers with your product as quickly as possible"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.sales.use.case.2.title"
msgstr "Contract administration"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.sales.use.case.2.description"
msgstr "Manage or generate contracts with Taskwolf to save time and keep track of the status of your customers"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.sales.use.case.3.title"
msgstr "Find and engage leads"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.sales.use.case.3.description"
msgstr "Keep your leads interested in your product by making the entire process up to the conclusion of the contract as simple and quick as possible for your customers"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.marketing"
msgstr "Marketing"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.marketing.use.case.1.title"
msgstr "Launch of campaigns"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.marketing.use.case.1.description"
msgstr "Publish campaigns at set times to acquire new customers at regular intervals"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.marketing.use.case.2.title"
msgstr "Content generation"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.marketing.use.case.2.description"
msgstr "Generate and publish new content on various social media platforms to keep your customers up to date about your products"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.marketing.use.case.3.title"
msgstr "All in one"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.marketing.use.case.3.description"
msgstr "Bundle your numerous channels on our platform to maintain the best possible overview of your campaigns. We manage all your high-profile accounts at once"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.finances"
msgstr "Finances"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.finances.use.case.1.title"
msgstr "Maintaining an overview"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.finances.use.case.1.description"
msgstr "Use Taskwolf to manage your finances clearly, for example by recording all transactions in a Google Docs document and printing them out automatically on a regular basis"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.finances.use.case.2.title"
msgstr "Automate customer invoices"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.finances.use.case.2.description"
msgstr "Improve your cash flow by automating the creation, management and distribution of customer invoices"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.finances.use.case.3.title"
msgstr "Backup important documents"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.finances.use.case.3.description"
msgstr "Save important documents not only in paper form, but also digitally and upload them fully automatically and regularly to a cloud of your choice"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.hr"
msgstr "Human Resources"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.hr.use.case.1.title"
msgstr "Employee processes"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.hr.use.case.1.description"
msgstr "Automate the onboarding / offboarding of employees and record the process in taskwolf processes"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.hr.use.case.2.title"
msgstr "Overview of employees"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.hr.use.case.2.description"
msgstr "Keep an overview of your employees by, for example, always keeping employee data up to date through workflows"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.hr.use.case.3.title"
msgstr "Employee recruitment"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.hr.use.case.3.description"
msgstr "Use Taskwolf to continuously find the best employees on the market. Make them aware of your company through targeted campaigns and retain them"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.developer"
msgstr "Developers"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.developer.use.case.1.title"
msgstr "Webhook connection"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.developer.use.case.1.description"
msgstr "Use our webhooks to connect any of your applications to Taskwolf and trigger workflows or receive results from workflows"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.developer.use.case.2.title"
msgstr "A better customer experience"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.developer.use.case.2.description"
msgstr "Offer your customers a better experience with your applications by integrating the apps your customers use every day into your applications without a lot of work"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.developer.use.case.3.title"
msgstr "Involve employees"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.developer.use.case.3.description"
msgstr "Involve regular employees in the development process, for example by creating new Github issues when bugs occur without the employee needing direct Github access"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.creatives"
msgstr "Creatives"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.creatives.use.case.1.title"
msgstr "Work backup"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.creatives.use.case.1.description"
msgstr "Synchronize your work, directly from your device, automatically with a cloud like Google Drive so your data is never lost again"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.creatives.use.case.2.title"
msgstr "Publication of work"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.creatives.use.case.2.description"
msgstr "Plan and publish your work completely automatically by uploading it to a platform of your choice, for example"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.creatives.use.case.3.title"
msgstr "Conversion of files"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.creatives.use.case.3.description"
msgstr "Use Taskwolf to automatically convert files into different formats to avoid unnecessary and repetitive work"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.support"
msgstr "Support"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.support.use.case.1.title"
msgstr "Notifications"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.support.use.case.1.description"
msgstr "Receive notifications when new emails or requests are received"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.support.use.case.2.title"
msgstr "Automatic reply"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.support.use.case.2.description"
msgstr "Generate and send AI-generated responses to keep your customers happy"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.support.use.case.3.title"
msgstr "Forwarding of requests"
msgid "home.solution.jobs.support.use.case.3.description"
msgstr "Forward inquiries fully automatically to the right department to serve your customers as quickly as possible"
msgid "home.solution.apps.headline"
msgstr "Apps"
msgid "home.solution.apps.slogan"
msgstr "Let yourself be inspired"
msgid "home.solution.apps.description.1"
msgstr "Here you can see a few of the apps we offer."
msgid "home.solution.apps.description.2"
msgstr "Perhaps you see a constellation that appeals to you."
msgid "home.solution.get.headline"
msgstr "Interested?"
msgid "home.solution.get.slogan"
msgstr "Get Taskwolf now!"
msgid "home.solution.get.description"
msgstr "If you are now interested in our product, you can find out about our various offers and packages. There is sure to be something for you."
msgid "home.solution.get.button"
msgstr "GET IT NOW"

