msgstr "A webhook can be used, for example, to trigger a workflow through an external request. To do this, a service sends an HTTP request to our system, which triggers the workflow. A detailed documentation will follow soon."
msgid "product.help.question.delete.question"
msgstr "Can I delete my Taskwolf account?"
msgid "product.help.question.delete.answer"
msgstr "To delete your Taskwolf account, click on the banner at the top right, then select \"Settings\" and go to \"Account\". There you will find the option to delete your account."

